ots do not inventory `/etc`, so continued retention of `/etc/rsyncd.conf.pre-releases` is established from its successful creation and the absence of any removal in the complete command trace, rather than an independent final filesystem snapshot.","The lifecycle collector independently confirms boot changes, platform, listener, failed-unit state, and package health, but detailed tree integrity and denial behavior rely on executor-captured commands. Those commands are direct and internally consistent."]}
